      "news": [
        {
          "id": 992510,
          "name": "Assessment Quiz 1 ",
          "modified": 1791781638,
          "message": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\">Dear Students,</span></p><p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\">Hope you are well.</span></p><p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\">Assessment Quiz 1 is now open on the LMS and must be completed by Tuesday, 20th October. Please attempt it in good time so that any technical issues can be resolved before the deadline.</span></p><p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\">If you have any questions, please get in touch.</span></p><p></p><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\"></span><p> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\">Best,</span></p><p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;\">Navneet</span></p><p></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 984496,
          "name": "Group Formation &amp; Pre- Workshop Reminder",
          "modified": 1788942668,
          "message": "<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dear Students,</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">I hope you're doing well.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This is a gentle reminder to please form groups of four for the upcoming presentations in Week 6. Kindly email me the names of your group members.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">I've also included a link to the McKinsey report we discussed yesterday, \"Geopolitics and the Geometry of Global Trade: 2026 Update\" — <a href=\"https://www.mckinsey.com/mgi/our-research/geopolitics-and-the-geometry-of-global-trade-2026-update\">https://www.mckinsey.com/mgi/our-research/geopolitics-and-the-geometry-of-global-trade-2026-update</a></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Lastly, please make sure to go through the slides and recording ahead of next week's lecture, so we can have an engaging discussion in class.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Thank you very much for your cooperation.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Best,<br />Navneet</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>"
        }
      ],
